        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add Firefox release automation script]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41897</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41897"/>
        <updated>2025-11-21T09:55:30.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">It’s an automation script that helps to create Firefox release notes.</p>
<p dir="auto">I created the <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41896" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41896/hovercard">Firefox 145 release notes PR</a> using this script.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">To simplify release notes workflow.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">How it works, for example, with the newly released Firefox 145:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="node scripts/release-firefox.js 145"><pre class="notranslate">node scripts/release-firefox.js 145</pre></div>
<p dir="auto">What it does:</p>
<p dir="auto">Takes the newly released version as a parameter (N), and:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Removes active from N-1</li>
<li>Updates N to Stable
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Uncomments HTML, CSS, JavaScript “no notable changes” sections</li>
<li>Removes all other unused commented sections</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Updates N+1 to Beta</li>
<li>Adds Nightly N+2 page</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">For release dates, it uses official JSON API — <a href="https://whattrainisitnow.com/api/firefox/calendar/future/" rel="nofollow">https://whattrainisitnow.com/api/firefox/calendar/future/</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3610323814" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41896" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41896/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41896">#41896</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
